 semesters), warning is issued provided the CGPA of a student is less than the minimum required for the degree program.\nA student with a warning cannot register in a subsequent semester without approval of the relevant Head of Department or any other senior faculty nominated by him.\nAfter each semester (including the summer or the first semester), if the CGPA of a student is less than the required minimum, the Warning Count increases by one.\nIf Warning Count becomes three, the admission of student at the University is closed.\nIf the CGPA equals or exceeds the required minimum, the Warning Count becomes zero.\n| Programs | Minimum CGPA required to avoid Warning |\n | BBA/BS | 2.0 |\n | MBA/MS | 2.5 |\n | PhD | 3.0 |"}, {"rank": 4, "chunk_id": "grading-page-0007", "doc_id": "grading-page", "source": "grading-page.html", "section": "Warning/Probation", "page": 1, "doc_version": "2026", "superseded": false, "score": 0.7995, "text": "Warning/Probation\nthe Warning Count becomes zero. | Programs | Minimum CGPA required to avoid Warning | | BBA/BS | 2.0 | | MBA/MS | 2.5 | | PhD | 3.0 |\nThe admission will be cancelled automatically after completion of maximum duration allowed to earn a degree."}, {"rank": 5, "chunk_id": "prospectus-2026-academic-rules-and-regulations-0019", "doc_id": "prospectus-2026-academic-rules-and-regulations", "source": "prospectus-2026-academic-rules-and-regulations.pdf", "section": "Warning", "page": 2, "doc_version": "2026", "superseded": false, "score": 0.7941, "text": "Warning\non the degree issued to such high first semester.\na) Must register for all such courses, achievers. b) Application for withdrawal from in which the grade was F or U. course(s) must be countersigned CGPA 3.90 to 4.00 Summa Cum Laude b) Should register for all such by the parent or the guardian of CGPA 3.75 to 3.89 M agna Cum Laude courses, in which the grade was D, the student. CGPA 3.60 to 3.74 Cum Laude D+ or C-.\nc) Request for withdrawal must be\nc) Should not register for more than submitted to the Head of 11. Academic Warning/Probation five courses. Department (HOD) before the last\na) At the end of every semester d) Students with warning count = 2 day of classes. (including summer semester), MUST not register for a new"}, {"rank": 6, "chunk_id": "academic-rules-handbook-jun-2026-0110", "doc_id": "academic-rules-handbook-jun-2026", "source": "academic-rules-handbook-jun-2026.pdf", "section": "5.7 Academic Warning/Probation", "page": 25, "doc_version": "2026-06", "superseded": false, "score": 0.793, "text": "5.7 Academic Warning/Probation\n5.7 If the CGPA equals or exceeds 2.00 after the 1st or 2nd academic warning, the warning count is reset to zero."}], "prompt": {"hash": "sha256:3c133ff2e1d641b6f0b1767629daf4bd4fc258e7ffd57a61254ec5e9abec4e38", "template": "rahbar-answer/v1", "rules": "on"}, "model": {"provider": "hosted", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b", "temperature": 0.2, "max_tokens": 700, "timeout_s": 30.0, "response_format": "json_object", "prompt_template": "rahbar-answer/v1", "prompt_rules": "on", "attempts": 0, "tokens_in": 0, "tokens_out": 0}, "grounding": {"relevance_floor": 0.66, "top1_score": 0.8663, "abstain_reason": "fallback", "fallback": "invalid_output", "citations_dropped": 0}, "response": {"answer": "I could not produce a reliable answer from the documents just now. Please try again, or check with the Academic Office.", "answered_from_context": false, "confidence": "low", "abstain_reason": "fallback"}, "citations": [], "guardrails": [{"rail": "output_schema", "action": "fallback served", "reason": "invalid_output"}], "latency_ms": {"embed": 1707.6, "cache": 59.3, "retrieve": 251.6, "rails": 0.7, "generate": 6020.0, "cache_store": 3.6, "total": 8131.0}, "cache": "miss"}
